"""AH004-EXECUTION-GATE-v1: local transactional EFFECT reference gate.

Only the fixed SQL effect below is supported. No arbitrary callbacks, shell,
network, hard realtime, OS sandbox, clock attestation or safety-rate estimation.
An agent receives a Client, not admin/clock/db access. Python object privacy is
NOT an isolation boundary against arbitrary same-process or same-uid code.
